This module contains only AIDL interface definitions and the shared-memory IPC
client. It deliberately contains no GPL-only implementation code, so that
applications released under Apache-2.0 (or other compatible licenses) can use
this module under the Apache-2.0 terms without triggering GPLv3 obligations.
Choosing Apache-2.0 for this module does not grant any rights to the
`MenthaAR/` engine module, which is licensed under GPLv3 only.

SDK 的双许可说明：本模块仅包含 AIDL 与共享内存 IPC 客户端，不包含任何 GPL-only
实现代码。使用者可在 Apache-2.0 与 GPLv3 之间任选其一；选择 Apache-2.0 不会对
`MenthaAR/` 引擎模块（仅 GPLv3）产生任何授权。
